---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Telemetry Drops" description="Contact Telemetry Drops for OpenTelemetry course questions, team training, and workshops. Operated by Dose de Telemetria GmbH in Berlin, Germany.">
  <div class="container-custom py-16 max-w-3xl space-y-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Contact Telemetry Drops</h1>
    <p class="text-white/80">Telemetry Drops provides OpenTelemetry courses and workshops for software engineers, SREs, and DevOps professionals. Contact us for help choosing a course, questions about the curriculum, or discussions about training for your team.</p>
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Course and workshop questions</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">Email <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="mailto:contact@telemetrydrops.com">contact@telemetrydrops.com</a> or call <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="tel:+4917646554626">+49 176 4655-4626</a>. Include the course or workshop you are interested in and the topics you want to learn. For team training, tell us about your team's experience with OpenTelemetry.</p>
      <p class="text-white/80">You can compare the curriculum, price, and current availability on our <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="/products/">course pages</a>. Workshop dates and locations are listed on the <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="/events/">events page</a>. Enrollment links take you to our external learning platform.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Company information</h2>
      <address class="not-italic text-white/80">Dose de Telemetria GmbH<br />Hauptstr. 14<br />13158 Berlin<br />Germany</address>
      <p class="text-white/80">Juraci Paixão Kröhling is responsible for the site's content. See our <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="/imprint/">imprint</a> for company registration details and our <a class="text-telemetria-orange hover:underline" href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for information about how personal data is handled.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
